Logs.Reasoning:
All positives consist of any number of a’s or b’s, optionally followed by a single c with strict context:  
‑ a‑c may appear only at the end of the string;  
‑ b‑c must be followed by at least one a or b, or by a second c (which then ends the string);  
‑ a single “c” is allowed alone. No three consecutive c’s and no “bc” or “ac” with trailing symbols are permitted.
